## Stack

- Django
- django-unfold
- uv
- pytest-django
- Ruff
- WhiteNoise

## First Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env
make install
make migrate
make seed
make run
```

Open <http://127.0.0.1:8000/>. The root URL redirects to the private Unfold
admin.

Demo credentials if `make seed` was used:

```text
admin / admin123
```

## Main URLs

- `/`: redirects to `/admin/`
- `/admin/`: Unfold admin, application shell, and CRUD surface
- `/admin/core/workitem/`: sample model list with filters and search

## Quality Checks

```bash
make qa
```

## Design Notes

This starter intentionally uses Django admin plus Unfold as the product surface
for list/detail/create/update/delete, search, filters, permissions, and history.
If a custom workflow is needed, keep it private and integrated with the admin
instead of creating a separate frontend shell.
